D_8430: ' rumours 1-10 (saloon: night to remember)
DATA "I heard that Mimi lost her last ring in the outhouse!"
DATA "I heard that Mimi never uses a condom."
DATA "I heard that Enus is in love with Mimi"
DATA "Blasting the cesspool could be a disgusting mess."
DATA "Blasting the bank could be a rewarding experience."
DATA "Enus used to sell pumps, but he lost them in the mine."
DATA "Diamonds are a girl's best friend, if they are mounted."
DATA "Mounting a diamond is a painful penetration."
DATA "Mimi likes whips, treat her rough, say bad things."
DATA "There's no business like blow business!"

